 hands plus feet or knees\n- ordinary maintenance, yoga, or exercise without an actual lying state\n- normal lying on a bed, sofa, or another obvious normal rest support\n- mannequin, poster, or person only on a screen\n\nDo not label a true lying person negative merely because their knees are bent, an arm touches the ground, or they intended to lie down. Decide from the overall torso/pelvis support state.\n\nUNCERTAIN:\nReturn \"uncertain\" only when blur, occlusion, tiny scale, or an indeterminate support surface prevents reliable distinction between lying and a supported seated/kneeling/squatting/exercise posture.\n\nIf any real person clearly satisfies the positive definition, the image is positive. Base the result only on visible evidence. Return exactly one JSON object and no additional text:\n\n{\n  \"person_fallen\": \"positive\",\n  \"evidence\": \"brief visible evidence\"\n}\n\nThe value of \"person_fallen\" must be exactly \"positive\", \"negative\", or \"uncertain\".\n","stream":false,"format":"json","think":false,"options":{"temperature":0,"num_ctx":8192,"num_predict":256}},"image_sha256":"5236377d0e960a946da10b1df70dee4dedb6b1ee8dfab55782303b948b178395","timestamp_start_utc":"2026-08-26T15:13:40.934959+00:00","timestamp_end_utc":"2026-08-26T15:13:42.518187+00:00"}
